  "keyFeatures": [
    "Automated law assembly — aggregates all applicable statutes, rules, and case law for a specific case",
    "End-to-end case workspace shared by litigant and attorney",
    "Unified evidence intake — recordings, texts, court orders, financial documents",
    "AI-powered pattern detection — identifies behavior patterns, hidden assets, and order violations",
    "Learning Center — procedural and legal education for both litigants and attorneys",
    "Marketplace — searchable directory of attorneys, notaries, evaluators, and mediators",
    "Deadline and next-step tracking to prevent procedural losses",
    "Equal feature access regardless of representation status"
